<%
  // locals: lastReviewed (build month, e.g. "October 2026"), stamp, links.
-%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<%- include('sections/banner') -%>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('sections/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="page-static">
    <%- include('sections/header') %>
    <main id="main">
      <div class="container static-page">
        <p class="static-page__label">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="static-page__title">About Cookies <span class="static-page__sub">and Similar Technologies</span></h1>
        <div class="doc">
          <p><em>Last reviewed: <%= lastReviewed %></em></p>

          <h2>Summary</h2>
          <p>This website only uses cookies and similar technologies to provide essential functionality. No tracking or analytics cookies are used.</p>

          <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
          <p>Cookies are small files saved on your device when you visit a website. We use them to make CodesThings.com work correctly.</p>

          <h2>Essential storage</h2>
          <p>The following items are stored locally on your device, in your browser's <code>localStorage</code> or <code>sessionStorage</code>. They never leave your device, and are never sent to any server operated by this site.</p>
          <%- include('sections/storage-keys') %>

          <h2>Third-party services</h2>
          <p>Fonts, icons and scripts are served from this site, not from third parties. The following services are involved:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong>: this site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Subject to <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>YouTube</strong>: the ZeroCalc blog post shows a click-to-load video. Nothing is requested from YouTube until you click it. After that, the video loads from <code>youtube-nocookie.com</code>, which may set its own cookies or log requests. Subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
          <p>You can manage or delete cookies and local storage through your browser settings. Clearing local storage will reset your theme, navigation and motion settings, the Campsnap dismissal and the game high score.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings, Privacy and Security, Cookies and other site data</li>
            <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Settings, Privacy &amp; Security, Cookies and Site Data</li>
            <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences, Privacy, Manage Website Data</li>
            <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings, Cookies and site permissions</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>More information</h2>
          <p>The <a href="https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/guide-to-pecr/guidance-on-the-use-of-cookies-and-similar-technologies/what-are-cookies-and-similar-technologies/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Information Commissioner's Office</a> provides up-to-date guidance on the use of cookies and similar technologies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('sections/footer') %>
    <script type="module" src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
